/T (1. Start the program  2. Create project files \(server.js, db.js, HTML, CSS, JS\) 3. Design product structure \(id, name, price\)  4. Create Node.js server using Express  5. Enable JSON parsing using middleware  6. Implement POST method to add products  7. Implement GET method to fetch all products  8. Implement PUT method to update product details 9. Implement DELETE method to remove a product 10. Store product data in memory using db.js  11. Send JSON responses for all API requests  12. Test APIs using browser or REST client )
